    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like you actually get it. everyone else just tells me to \"hang in there\" or \"it gets better,\" but they don't realize that me hanging in there is literally what's hurting them. it's so selfish of me to keep dragging them through this. it would be such a relief to just... do something kind for them for once. to finally let them breathe without me around.",
